msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:93
#: e373ead34da142918157053efc576fe4
msgid "RC input is configured on the RX2 pin. It supports all single wire RC protocols except bi-directional serial protocols such as CRSF, ELRS, etc. Instead, these devices can be connected using both TX2 and RX2 if if :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 and :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:96
#: dc4afff7a35e484ca04f0730ab9c84ff
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:98
#: 1e9dde99c4e74ac0bdbc768372085dd2
msgid "DSM/SRXL connects to the RX2  pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:100
#: 860fb071c4d24eb09ab27985788a2a8d
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX2 and RX2 via a bi-directional inverter. See :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:102
#: a095c53f2495403ab4db423d0cb74f7f
msgid "CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` to \"23\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:104
#: b20045ca23c84e32b4602b67b4794a25
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\" and :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` set \"23\"."
msgstr ""

